        title: 'Tip',
        description: "In 9-Card Brag, a Flush is a 'medium' hand; don't rely on it to win the front hand.",
      },
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: 'Count the Aces—there are only four. If you have two, the odds of an opponent holding a Prial of Aces is near zero.',
